                        "sense_id": "83dbbdb9-b87e-343c-bb95-53eeda1a1a4d",
                        "entry_id": "86354e46-6a34-32e6-aa17-3251519b9b95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A murder by drowning, especially one of those carried out during the French Reign of Terror."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "611faf92-6fa1-4c65-af61-376cb69f4633",
                                "sense_id": "83dbbdb9-b87e-343c-bb95-53eeda1a1a4d",
                                "text": "By degrees, daylight itself witnesses Noyades: women and men are tied together, feet and feet, hands and hands; and flung in: this they call Mariage Républicain, Republican Marriage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e7256bc-e383-4b39-b9a7-dac81943e54b",
                                "sense_id": "83dbbdb9-b87e-343c-bb95-53eeda1a1a4d",
                                "text": "Alongside this, there were the infamous noyades: perhaps 2,000 alleged counter-revolutionaries strapped in to barges were towed into the river Loire where the barges were scuppered, leaving the victims to drown."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
